## Shaft

::bg{location="shaft" time="dawn"}
::vfx{type="whiteOut"}
@ilo{code="0010" mono}: Light. Up there. Kick. Kick.
@narrator{code="0010"}: He breaks the surface with his lungs on fire and the palace's cold still in his teeth.
